DESCRIPTION:Event by Southeast Steuben County Library\n100 Nasser Civic Ce
 nter Plaza\nCorning\, NY\nPublic\nThe Friends of the Library Early Fall Bo
 ok Sale takes place from August 22 through 29\, 2026\, at the United Steel
 workers Local 1000 Union Hall\, 100 Nasser Civic Center Plaza\, Corning\, 
 New York. Find your favorite books\, music\, movies\, puzzles\, games and 
 more among the 30\,000+ items being offered. All proceeds benefit the Sout
 heast Steuben County Library.\nThe sale starts Saturday\, August 22 with a
  Members Only day from 9:00 AM until 4:00 PM. If you aren’t already a me
 mber of the Friends of the Library\, you can join at the door: $5 for an i
 ndividual and $10 for families.\nThe full sale schedule is as follows:\nSa
 turday\, August 22 – 9:00 AM – 4:00 PM\, Members only. This is the bes
 t day to look for those rare finds!\nSunday\, August 23 – Noon – 5:00 
 PM\, Open to the public.\nMonday\, August 24– Thursday\, August 27 – 9
 :00 AM -7:00 PM\, Open to the public.\nFriday\, August 28 – 9:00 AM – 
 5:00 PM\, Open to the public.\nSaturday\, August 29 – 9:00 AM – 2:00 P
 M\, Open to the public. This is box and bag day: $5 and up for a box or ba
 g (depending on the size).\nCash or check only. No credit cards accepted. 
 The Friends of the Library are required to collect NY State sales tax\; if
  you have a tax-exempt form please bring it\, as we must charge tax withou
 t it.\n\nSource: FLXcalendar - https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/784
 40376/20260828090000
STATUS:CONFIRMED
