 lks Lodge - 300 E. Gray St.\n5PM: Larry B & The Roc Docs | 7PM: The Variab
 les\nAug 14 | Ill Eagle Taphouse - 200 E. Church St.\n5PM: Blue Eyed Soul 
 | 7PM: Sway\nAug 28 | Rye Bar - 365 Davis St.\n5PM: Gravy Boat | 7PM: Blac
 k Bush\nSep 11 | Empire Sports - 300 N. Main St.\n5PM: Far | 7PM: Nicholas
  Stark & These Dudes\nFree to attend | $5 wristband to drink\nGrab a 2026 
 AA5 Cup for series savings all summer long!\nVenues rotate throughout Down
 town Elmira\, so check the full schedule at elmiradowntown.com\n\nSource: 
