BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Little Keys- Journey to the Magic Garden
DTSTART:20260829T150000Z
DTEND:20260830T035959Z
DTSTAMP:20260828T204937Z
UID:a4e8d316ec3bc6ae49b0317a4216291e28e1fc1e@corning-events
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Family Fun
DESCRIPTION:Event by Unlocked Holistic and Soulful Solutions\n200 East Chu
 rch Street Suite 310\nElmira\, NY\nPublic\nLittle Keys: Journey to the Mag
 ic Garden\nA Magical Kids Sound Bath Experience\nStep into a world of imag
 ination\, connection\, and calm as we journey together into the Magic Gard
 en.\nThis special parent-and-child experience is designed to help children
  slow down\, relax\, and explore mindfulness through the soothing sounds o
 f crystal singing bowls\, chimes\, gentle percussion\, storytelling\, and 
 guided meditation.\nTogether\, we'll unlock the Magic Garden\, discover ou
 r special golden keys\, practice calming breaths\, and enjoy a peaceful so
 und bath that encourages creativity\, confidence\, and emotional well-bein
 g.\nEach child will also receive a special affirmation card and coloring p
 age to take home\, helping them carry a little bit of the Magic Garden wit
 h them long after the session ends.\nPlease bring:\n- Your child's favorit
 e blanket or plushie\n- A water bottle\n- An open heart and a sense of adv
 enture!\nEverything else is provided.\nSliding Scale: $10–$25 per pair (
 Pay What You Can)\nSpace is limited. Reservations are required.\nText 607-
 331-0932 (text friendly) to reserve your spot.\nCome make magical memories
 \, breathe deeply\, and discover that the greatest magic has been inside y
 ou all along.\n\nSource: FLXcalendar - https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/e
 vent/78441641/20260829110000
STATUS:CONFIRMED
URL:https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78441641/20260829110000
END:VEVENT
