DESCRIPTION:Essence Healing\n56 E. First Street\nCorning\, NY\nNeed a brea
 k from the daily grind?\nJoin us on the last Sunday of each month from 3:0
 0–4:00 PM for a relaxing meditation experience paired with a warm cup of
  custom-blended organic meditation tea. This gathering is designed to supp
 ort the mind\, soul\, and spirit through simple yet powerful practices.\nP
 articipants will:\nNurture the Mind through wisdom teachings that encourag
 e greater awareness and expanded consciousness.\nNourish the Soul with the
  deeply restorative Max Meditation™ technique.\nNourish the Spirit throu
 gh prayer and intentional reflection\, creating space for clarity\, peace
 \, and renewed strength.\nGather in Community in a welcoming space for per
 sonal growth\, connection\, and spiritual renewal.\nWhether you're brand n
 ew to meditation or have an established practice\, everyone is welcome.\nU
 pcoming 2026 dates:\nJuly 26\nAugust 30\nSeptember 27\nOctober 25\nNovembe
 r 29\nDecember 27\nHosted by Paula Lee Healing at Essence Healing.\nEvent 
 details can be found here:\nhttps://www.paulaleehealing.com/event-calendar
