 4 hr\nPublic\nMark your calendars! The PRC will be holding our annual Chil
 dren's Rummage Sale fundraiser! All proceeds will fund PRC programming. Th
 e sale will be held on the 2nd floor of the Southeast Steuben County Libra
 ry building. Follow the signs once you reach the 2nd floor.\nPrior to Thur
 sday\, September 10\, we will gratefully accept your gently used donations
 ! We can accept clean toys and equipment\, freshly laundered baby\, toddle
 r\, and children’s clothes (without stains/tears)\, baby supplies\, chil
 dren's books\, and games.\nPlease note: Donations can only be accepted dur
 ing our Drop-In Play hours. Please do not leave items outside our door whe
 n we are closed. Please do not include stained or damaged items. We are un
