DESCRIPTION:Event by Clemens Center\n207 Clemens Center Pkwy\nElmira\, NY
 \nPublic\nThe M&T Bank 2025-26 Broadway Season presents\nMystic Pizza\nSat
 urday\, September 26\, 2026 @ 7:30pm\nSunday\, September 27\, 2026 @ 2:00p
 m\nSeason tickets on sale now at ClemensCenter.org\nIndividual tickets wil
 l be on sale at a later date\n---------------\n"An undeniably charming new
  musical serving up 1980s nostalgia!" Stage Raw\nMystic Pizza: A New Music
 al delivers the beloved story from the iconic hit film driven by a score p
 acked with unforgettable hits from the ’80s and ’90s. Follow best frie
 nds Kat\, Daisy\, and Jojo as they navigate the complexities of friendship
  and romance—all while slinging slices at a small-town pizza joint. Burs
 ting with laugh-out-loud moments\, heartfelt storytelling\, and chart-topp
 ers including “Hit Me With Your Best Shot\,” “Hold On\,” and “Ma
 nic Monday\,” Mystic Pizza is a joyful celebration of chasing dreams\, l
 ifelong bonds\, and finding your place in the world.\nCritics are hungry f
 or more: Stage Scene LA calls Mystic Pizza a “surefire hit\,” featurin
 g “one show-stopping dance sequence after another\,” while NJ Stage pr
 aises the show as “funny\, heartwarming\, and nostalgic".\nAge Recommend
 ation: Ages 13+\nDates/times/programs/prices are subject to change.\n-----
 ----------\nWe acknowledge these business members who support the Clemens 
 Center programming throughout the year:\nArnot Health • Chemung Supply 
 • Chemung Canal Trust Company • Guthrie • Streeter Associates\n\nSou
 rce: FLXcalendar - https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78439038/202609
 26193000
GEO:42.08921;-76.804956
LOCATION:Clemens Center\, 207 Clemens Center Parkway\, Elmira\, New York\,
  14901
STATUS:CONFIRMED
URL:https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78439038/20260926193000
END:VEVENT
